> - 对象类：画布边界/canvas_boundary, 边缘行列/edge_row_column, 边界标记/boundary_marker, 微型片段/micro_fragment, 周期性格/periodic_lattice, 缺失像素/missing_pixel, 封闭区域/enclosed_region, 连通分量/connected_component, 面板帧/panel_frame, 分隔行/separator_row, 前景精灵/foreground_sprite, 起始块/start_block, 目标块/target_block, 走廊路径/corridor_path, 带孔对象/object_with_holes, 标记形状/marker_shape, 连接标记/connector_marker, 前景物体/foreground_object, 圆角边框/rounded_frame, 内部图案/inner_pattern, 边缘条/edge_bar, 控制像素/control_pixel, 线段/line_segment, 精灵体/sprite, 锚点/anchor, 轨道点/track_dot, 同形精灵体/identical_sprite, 行列格点/row_column_lattice, 端点像素/endpoint_pixel, 直角路径/right_angle_path, 填充矩形/filled_rectangle, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 外部精灵/external_sprite, 全宽条纹/full_width_stripe, 十字图案/plus_pattern, 网格边缘/grid_edge, 掩码/mask, 分隔列/separator_column, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 封闭孔洞/enclosed_hole, 轮廓线/outline, 方向标记/direction_marker, 模板对象/template_object
